    "status" : "extensions",
    "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ng-hiv-int-lab-viral-load-indication-vs</b></p><a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-viral-load-indication-vs\"> </a><a name=\"hcng-hiv-int-lab-viral-load-indication-vs\"> </a><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html\"><code>https://fhir-ig.digitalhealth.gov.ng/CodeSystem/ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version &#x1F4E6;0.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-vl-indication-baseline-six-months\">vl-indication-baseline-six-months</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Baseline: six months after ART initiation</td><td>Baseline viral-load testing six months after ART initiation.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-vl-indication-routine-annual\">vl-indication-routine-annual</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Routine: every 12 months</td><td>Routine annual viral-load monitoring.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-vl-indication-clinical-immunologic-failure\">vl-indication-clinical-immunologic-failure</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Clinical or immunologic failure</td><td>Viral-load testing requested because of suspected clinical or immunologic treatment failure.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-vl-indication-gestation-32-36-weeks\">vl-indication-gestation-32-36-weeks</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">32–36 weeks of gestation</td><td>Viral-load testing requested at 32–36 weeks of gestation.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-vl-indication-confirmation-after-eac\">vl-indication-confirmation-after-eac</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Confirmation: three to six months after EAC</td><td>Confirmatory viral-load testing three to six months after enhanced adherence counselling.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-vl-indication-recent-infection\">vl-indication-recent-infection</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Recent infection</td><td>Viral-load testing requested in the context of recent HIV infection.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-vl-indication-early-hiv-detection\">vl-indication-early-hiv-detection</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Early HIV detection</td><td>Viral-load testing requested for early HIV detection.</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
